{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":65,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. A Psalm by David. A song."},{"n":1,"text":"Praise waits for you, God, in Zion. Vows shall be performed to you.","tok":[{"t":"Praise waits "},{"t":"for","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" you, God, "},{"t":"in","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" Zion. Vows "},{"t":"shall","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" performed "},{"t":"to","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" you."}]},{"n":2,"text":"You who hear prayer, all men will come to you.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H6726"]},{"t":" who hear prayer, all men "},{"t":"will","s":["H6726"]},{"t":" come "},{"t":"to","s":["H8416"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H6726"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Sins overwhelmed me, but you atoned for our transgressions.","tok":[{"t":"Sins overwhelmed "},{"t":"me","s":["H3605"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"but","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" atoned "},{"t":"for","s":["H5704"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"our","s":["H3605"]},{"t":" transgressions."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Blessed is the one whom you choose and cause to come near, that he may live in your courts. We will be filled with the goodness of your house, your holy temple.","tok":[{"t":"Blessed "},{"t":"is","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"one","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" whom "},{"t":"you","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" choose "},{"t":"and","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"cause","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"to","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" come near, "},{"t":"that","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"he","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"may","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" live "},{"t":"in","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" courts. "},{"t":"We","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"be","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" filled "},{"t":"with","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" goodness "},{"t":"of","s":["H1697"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" house, "},{"t":"your","s":["H4480"]},{"t":" holy temple."}]},{"n":5,"text"