","s":["H3220"]},{"t":" faraway places "},{"t":"are","s":["H1995"]},{"t":" afraid "},{"t":"at","s":["H3220"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H7623"]},{"t":" wonders. You call "},{"t":"the","s":["H7623"]},{"t":" morning’s dawn "},{"t":"and","s":["H3220"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H7623"]},{"t":" evening "},{"t":"with","s":["H3220"]},{"t":" songs "},{"t":"of","s":["H1995"]},{"t":" joy."}]},{"n":9,"text":"You visit the earth, and water it. You greatly enrich it. The river of God is full of water. You provide them grain, for so you have ordained it.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" visit "},{"t":"the","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" earth, "},{"t":"and","s":["H1242"]},{"t":" water "},{"t":"it","s":["H1242"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"You","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" greatly enrich "},{"t":"it","s":["H1242"]},{"t":". "},{"t":"The","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" river "},{"t":"of","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" God "},{"t":"is","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" full "},{"t":"of","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" water. "},{"t":"You","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" provide "},{"t":"them","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" grain, "},{"t":"for","s":["H7442"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"so","s":["H3427"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"you","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H3372"]},{"t":" ordained "},{"t":"it","s":["H1242"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"You drench its furrows. You level its ridges. You soften it with showers. You bless it with a crop.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" drench "},{"t":"its","s":["H4390"]},{"t":" furrows. "},{"t":"You","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" level "},{"t":"its","s":["H4390"]},{"t":" ridges. "},{"t":"You","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" soften "},{"t":"it","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H4390"]},{"t":" showers. "},{"t":"You","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" bless "},{"t":"it","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H4390"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"a","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" crop."}]},{"n":11,"text":"You crown the year with your bounty. Your carts overflow with abundance.","tok":[{"t":"You","s":["H1288"]},{"t":" crown "},{"t":"the","s":["H1288"]},{"t":" y